<title>USA: Rogers Cty ISD 4, Okla., won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Rogers Cty ISD 4, Okla., won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $1.300 million of Rogers Cty ISD 4, Okla., combined purpose bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.62 percent.</p>
